  "Description": {
    "Cost": 4003539,
    "UIName": "Vandal",
    "Id": "chassisdef_vandal_LI-OA",
    "Name": "Vandal",
    "Details": "The A is intended to serve as the command vehicle of a C3-boosted lance. Aside from being equipped with a C3 boosted master, the 'Mech's main weapon is a Heavy PPC which is connected to a PPC Capacitor found in the left arm. Its secondary weapon is a 4-tubed Short-Range Missile launcher with a single ton of ammunition in the right torso. A single Laser Anti-Missile System is placed in the 'Mech's right arm; also, an additional Double Heat Sink and four Jump Jets round out the 'Mech's equipment.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Variable Range Targeting</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.04</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_starhawk"
  },
