  "StockRole": "Skirmisher",
  "YangsThoughts": "Introduced in the 3140s, the Vandal is a Heavy Class OmniMech produced by the Capellan Confederation. The Vandal is designed to be a speedy and tough combat unit, while it is also meant to work as a team player in combat. Found in virtually all of its original OmniPod configurations, the 'Mech would feature the usage of C3 boosted slave communication systems. The 'Mech would see deployment with Confederation allies which includes the Magistracy of Canopus.",
